## Modules by flow

- **HLD (14):** foundations … case-studies + `systems-fundamentals-lab`, `reliability-observability-lab`, `data-storage-lab`, `security-operations-lab`, `distributed-systems-lab`
- **LLD (6):** lld-foundations … lld-machine-coding + `lld-design-patterns-lab`, `lld-project-labs`
- **DSA (8):** `dsa-concepts-lab`, `dsa-algorithms-lab`, `dsa-patterns-lab`, `dsa-search-lab`, then dsa-foundations … dsa-mock-loops
- **AI (10):** ml-foundations … data-engineering-for-ml + `ml-interactive-lab`, `deep-learning-from-scratch`
- **Question bank (4):** question-bank-top-sets, question-bank-faang, question-bank-more-companies, question-bank-strategy

## Lesson shape (typical)

`slug`, `title`, `summary`, `duration`, `whyItMatters`, `sections[]` (`heading`, `body`, `bullets?`, `codeExample?`), `checklist[]`, `pitfalls[]`, `interviewPrompts[]`, `diagram|null`, `related[]`. Optional: `likelyAnswerPoints`, `practiceMode`, `runtimeTarget`, `questionHighlights`, `questionBank`, `exercises`, `interactive`. DSA/AI/HLD learning labs may use `exercises[]` with `starterCode`, `solution`, `hints`, and `expectedOutput` for in-page coding practice, plus `type: 'design'` drills where authored.

AI learning expansion lessons under `ml-interactive-lab` and `deep-learning-from-scratch` are self-contained concept lessons: 5-7 long sections per lesson, multiple `codeExample` snippets, and at least two runnable coding exercises. DSA learning expansion lessons under the four DSA labs follow the same density and also ship design drills.

HLD exhaustive labs (`data-storage-lab`, `security-operations-lab`, `distributed-systems-lab`) are self-contained: 6 long sections, multiple `codeExample`s, design + coding exercises, curated `likelyAnswerPoints`, interactive topic labs, deep dives, and module-specific simulation blueprints.

The generated exhaustive HLD labs in `scripts/hld_lab_content.py` are updated for 2026 interview expectations: storage lessons now cover ANN/vector indexing (`pgvector`, HNSW/IVF) and lakehouse/open-table analytics (`Iceberg` with Delta/Hudi peers), security lessons emphasize zero trust, passkeys/WebAuthn, workload identity, scoped credential vending, and sensitive-data-safe telemetry, and distributed lessons now frame cell-based isolation, control-plane consensus, and durable workflow engines as mainstream patterns.

Ids: `{moduleSlug}/{lessonSlug}` via `normalizeModule()`.

## Deep knowledge (`lessonDeepKnowledge.js`)

- `getLessonDeepKnowledge(lessonId)` — curated deeper insights + external references per lesson
- Sources under `deepKnowledge/` including `learningExpansionDeepKnowledge.js` (spreads `hldExhaustiveLabDeepKnowledge.js` plus DSA pattern snippets) for all 39 expansion lessons
- Each entry: `insights[]` (`heading`, `body`) and `references[]` (`title`, `url`, `source`, `note`)
- Loaded in lesson route (`+page.js`) and rendered in the lesson page **Deep dive** section

## Banks and extras

- Question JSON (lazy in `QuestionBankIDE`): `top-interview-questions-*.json`, company files, strategy files — normalized by `src/lib/dsa/questionBank.js`
- DSA also pulls `all-companies-questions.json`, `leetcode-companies.json`
- `interactiveLessons.js` — authored topic labs (`getInteractiveLesson`), including `learningExpansionInteractive.js` for all 39 expansion lessons
- Expansion lessons include on-page teaching sections, code examples, exercises, interactive topic labs, and deep-dive essays (not reference-only), including `learningExpansionInteractive.js`
- `simulationLessons.js` — authored + generated HLD sims; module blueprints include the three exhaustive HLD lab modules
- `scripts/hld_lab_content.py` + `scripts/build_hld_exhaustive_labs.py` — author/regenerate exhaustive HLD lab payloads
- `lessonEnhancements.js` + `solutionLoader.js` — rich solutions for case studies
- Diagrams: `/primer-images/*` under `static/` (asserted in `tests/courseData.test.js`)
